{"668750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cthulhu's Cleanup Crew", "steam_appid": 668750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/48fbb272f7e44ce24265d3a0d5e01dc4.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/48fbb272f7e44ce24265d3a0d5e01dc4.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/48fbb272f7e44ce24265d3a0d5e01dc4.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just been hired as employee number one at the only Reality Repair Co. in the cosmos, run by a reformed eldritch horror who'd genuinely rather be painting than killing. Restore broken realities, keep the office from descending into madness, grow the business, and climb the most horizontal career ladder in existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/f667f521ba1e063cc285f059a04fc101.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/f667f521ba1e063cc285f059a04fc101.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/f667f521ba1e063cc285f059a04fc101.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Restore Voxel Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a reality-paint gun, you reveal and explore voxel environments one trigger-pull at a time, piecing together what was lost and discovering what actually caused the cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/8cbbf1808eeecf340e407c609d75bdd8.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/8cbbf1808eeecf340e407c609d75bdd8.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/8cbbf1808eeecf340e407c609d75bdd8.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the 9-5 job sim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs for your boss to receive payment, and cash in your collected items to climb the performance review ladder. As Cthulhu's best and only employee, keeping things running is your job. Trust us: you don't want to let the insanity filters clog up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/018320b3f164e10355a2b9d9046a9a27.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/018320b3f164e10355a2b9d9046a9a27.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/018320b3f164e10355a2b9d9046a9a27.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your gear and office</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your accolades to upgrade your equipment, unlock new tools, and improve your efficiency in the reality repair business </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/2e33e566ffdbf654a8d453e73dcedaa9.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/2e33e566ffdbf654a8d453e73dcedaa9.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/2e33e566ffdbf654a8d453e73dcedaa9.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Horrific secrets and collectables </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues, investigate metaphysical accidents, and unravel the mysteries behind this lost reality. Collect office souvenirs, discover artifacts, and find hidden objects in every world you restore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of hidden objects from the mundane to the mysterious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with no fail states or time limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cthulhu's darkly optimistic commentary on everything you reveal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world tells a story about what was (and what probably shouldn't have been)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for: Fans of cozy games who also appreciate cosmic horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/48fbb272f7e44ce24265d3a0d5e01dc4.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/48fbb272f7e44ce24265d3a0d5e01dc4.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/48fbb272f7e44ce24265d3a0d5e01dc4.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just been hired as employee number one at the only Reality Repair Co. in the cosmos, run by a reformed eldritch horror who'd genuinely rather be painting than killing. Restore broken realities, keep the office from descending into madness, grow the business, and climb the most horizontal career ladder in existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/f667f521ba1e063cc285f059a04fc101.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/f667f521ba1e063cc285f059a04fc101.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/f667f521ba1e063cc285f059a04fc101.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Restore Voxel Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a reality-paint gun, you reveal and explore voxel environments one trigger-pull at a time, piecing together what was lost and discovering what actually caused the cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/8cbbf1808eeecf340e407c609d75bdd8.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/8cbbf1808eeecf340e407c609d75bdd8.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/8cbbf1808eeecf340e407c609d75bdd8.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the 9-5 job sim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs for your boss to receive payment, and cash in your collected items to climb the performance review ladder. As Cthulhu's best and only employee, keeping things running is your job. Trust us: you don't want to let the insanity filters clog up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/018320b3f164e10355a2b9d9046a9a27.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/018320b3f164e10355a2b9d9046a9a27.webm?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/018320b3f164e10355a2b9d9046a9a27.mp4?t=1787668808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your gear and office</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your accolades to upgrade your equipment, unlock new tools, and improve your efficiency in the reality repair business </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668750/extras/2e33e566ffdbf654a8d453e73dcedaa9.poster.avif?t=1787668808\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co